{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Kosmocean - The Endless Sea",
    "steam_appid": 2144610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/5fdda3c3726af0c3f94712bf317e2b31.avif?t=1748705772\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/71b8e4ce58f744de7b63495e445e4813.avif?t=1748705772\" /></div>Kosmocean, a planet covered by water, where humans survive on tiny islands, and factions lay spread across the sea - Viridis islands, that bordered on a pastoral lands, Utopia platform with its ancient steel Submarines, Cult of Noun and its Firetop Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Ikki, a young boy living on a small island with his intrepid grandfather who taught him everything he knows. Together they built Bathys, a pocket submarine, using recyled material, flotsom and jetsom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a catastrophe with an unknown cause, our heros, Ikki and his grandfather are separated. All that is left is the incomplete logbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll descend miles below the surface, where the sun never shines, where terrible currents, monstrous creatures and terrifying pressure are an insurmountable barrier to your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where the ocean seems to have no bottom, a new world beneath the sea may hold the key to the survival of humanity\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will discover a detailed water world brought to life with hand-drawn animated graphics and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/5fdda3c3726af0c3f94712bf317e2b31.avif?t=1748705772\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/71b8e4ce58f744de7b63495e445e4813.avif?t=1748705772\" /></div>Kosmocean, a planet covered by water, where humans survive on tiny islands, and factions lay spread across the sea - Viridis islands, that bordered on a pastoral lands, Utopia platform with its ancient steel Submarines, Cult of Noun and its Firetop Mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Ikki, a young boy living on a small island with his intrepid grandfather who taught him everything he knows. Together they built Bathys, a pocket submarine, using recyled material, flotsom and jetsom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/c29f34369bbe3bb2a0896758104699fd.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/a86497c98247ce6ad5615da5504ec79c.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a catastrophe with an unknown cause, our heros, Ikki and his grandfather are separated. All that is left is the incomplete logbook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll descend miles below the surface, where the sun never shines, where terrible currents, monstrous creatures and terrifying pressure are an insurmountable barrier to your progress. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where the ocean seems to have no bottom, a new world beneath the sea may hold the key to the survival of humanity\u2026 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will discover a detailed water world brought to life with hand-drawn animated graphics and immersive sound design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.poster.avif?t=1748705772\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.webm?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144610/extras/2d9ce0ba151bf6f67fb1d38cf0aa8116.mp4?t=1748705772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Adventure and submarine exploration game. Control your Bathyscaphe with the help of a logbook. Through the game puzzles, bullet-hell sequences, and skill-based challenges, you will be plunged miles and miles into the depths where the ocean seems to have no end.",
